       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-QUANTUM-FIELD-QUALIFICATION-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ADVANCED-QUALIFICATIONS.
           05  WS-YUL-SCSI-KEYCODES-MATCH  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DISCHARGE-FET-VERLET-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-ENDOWMENT-SAAT-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-AHO-CORASICK-SUB-US-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NO-CHILD-LANGMUIR-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-ADVANCED-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-FULL-QUALIFICATION-MET   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-QUAL-CODE          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-AUDIT-HARDWARE-REGISTERS.
           PERFORM 2000-AUDIT-FET-AND-CIVIC-TERMS.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-QUALIFICATIONS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-AUDIT-HARDWARE-REGISTERS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-YUL-SCSI-KEYCODES-MATCH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-AHO-CORASICK-SUB-US-OK.
       2000-AUDIT-FET-AND-CIVIC-TERMS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DISCHARGE-FET-VERLET-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TEDDY_BEAR-ENDOWMENT-SAAT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NO-CHILD-LANGMUIR-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-QUALIFICATIONS.
           IF WS-YUL-SCSI-KEYCODES-MATCH = 1 AND
              WS-DISCHARGE-FET-VERLET-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TEDDY_BEAR-ENDOWMENT-SAAT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-AHO-CORASICK-SUB-US-OK = 1 AND
              WS-NO-CHILD-LANGMUIR-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-FULL-QUALIFICATION-MET
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-QUAL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-FULL-QUALIFICATION-MET
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-QUAL-CODE.
